      "heading": "Before and at Albion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mowbray led Albion to the 2007/08 Championship title. His first spell began with a 3–0 home win over Wolves in October 2006 and ended with a goalless draw at Blackburn in May 2009."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
